{
  "text": "You can build a service that helps an owner get a business ready to sell before there is even a buyer. Start with one question. Could this business run for 30 days without the owner? Ask them to explain how. Circle every answer that becomes I call, I approve, or I know. Beside each circle, write who else could act, what they would need, and what stops if nobody can. that gives you a first dependency map. It shows where the service starts. Transferring or documenting the knowledge, decisions and relationships the business still can't hand off.",
